Package: bigQTL
Title: Scalable Conditional QTL Analysis with File-Backed Matrices
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Immune", "Axisa", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "first.last@example.com")
Description: Performs conditional cis-QTL analysis (stepwise conditioning 
    and all-but-one) using file-backed genotype and feature matrices from 
    the bigstatsr/bigsnpr ecosystem. Includes eigenMT multiple testing 
    correction and data preparation utilities (genotype PCA, feature PCA, 
    RINT transformation).
